{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\">    科技｜華府封堵遙距取用芯片漏洞 Nscale向字節跳動供算力須先領牌           <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left tight-spacing neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">美國收緊芯片出口管制，並封堵中國企業以遙距方式取用美國先進芯片的漏洞。英國新型雲端服務商Nscale須向美國申請許可，才可繼續讓TikTok母公司字節跳動使用部署於冰島及挪威數據中心的英偉達圖形處理器，申請期限為90天。Nscale去年收入3,300萬美元，其中73%來自字節跳動，公司正計劃在紐約上市。  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T02:03:55.918549+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T01:00:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:57:31.252387+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T01:57:31.252387+00:00","content_hash":"abe648205af9c0d00a22caea72b6cd9588abd0eb25735b939abd6a70d5c2d10f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}